{"change_summary":"Completed the broken per-stage molt-timer rollout in `tank_core`: the shrimp system now compiles with Ca/Mg-aware molt-stress inputs, direct stage-timer molt resolution, and an explicit critical-GH failure gate so severe soft-water molts cannot succeed on good condition alone. I also bumped saves to schema 13 and added a 12→13 migration plus post-load normalization that backfills missing stage `molt_timer_days` from legacy `inter_molt_timer_days` while preserving explicit stage timers, then added focused shrimp/save regressions and revalidated the geometry-scaling harness.","outstanding_risks":["The geometry-scaling harness still uses the current wider chemistry parity band rather than the original 20% concentration target; this turn did not retune that model-level gap.","`CYCLE_TIMELINE_MATURITY_THRESHOLD = 0.04` in `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_geometry_scaling.rs` remains the same weak cycle-timeline proxy noted in review; I only revalidated the harness here.","I validated the touched core/save/harness targets, not the entire workspace, so unrelated suites outside those scopes were not rerun in this turn."],"steps":[{"description":"Finished the shrimp molt implementation by restoring the missing stage-timer helper path, folding calcium/magnesium into molt-stress accounting, and enforcing a critical GH failure gate during molt resolution.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Bumped save schema handling to v13 and added a migration plus post-load normalization that seeds missing stage molt timers from the legacy population-wide timer without overwriting explicit per-stage values.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Added focused regressions for direct stage-timer soft-water molt failure and for legacy save backfill/preservation of stage molt timers.","order":3,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran formatting, focused tank_core tests, focused clippy, and the geometry-scaling harness to verify the updated implementation state.","order":4,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test shrimp_population -- --nocapture` passed (22 tests, including the new direct stage-timer soft-water regression).","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load -- --nocapture` passed (36 tests, including the new schema v12→v13 molt-timer migration coverage).","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_geometry_scaling -- --nocapture` passed (3 tests).","`cargo clippy -p tank_core --test shrimp_population --test save_load -- -D warnings` passed."]}